     [38;5;246mAppend-only array of events, capped at N with oldest dropped. Real history, uniform shape for future forms. [39m
     [38;5;246mRecommended.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m B: last-state record
     [38;5;246mMost recent occurrence per event name, plus a count. Tiny and unbounded-growth-proof, but no sequence or history.[39m
